{"mem_mph6tbag_47267d81f875":{"concepts":["agentmemory","kilo","integration","testing","mcp","authorization","viewer","rest-api","test-coverage"],"content":"Agentmemory Kilo integration test coverage completed successfully. Added 33 new tests across mcp-standalone.test.ts and mcp-standalone-proxy.test.ts (49 + 25 tests = 74 total). All 98 test files pass with 1124 tests.\n\nCoverage added:\n- memory_export, memory_audit local fallback paths\n- AGENTMEMORY_SESSION_ID forwarding to proxy calls and local KV\n- handleToolsList proxy success/fallback paths\n- normalizeList edge cases (null, undefined, mixed arrays)\n- memory_save with explicit type, default type\n- handleProxyGeneric response shapes\n- Memory recall searches sessionIds, id fields\n- Whitespace validation, format lowercasing, string limit parsing\n\nAuthorization setup verified working:\n- AGENTMEMORY_SECRET stored in ~/.agentmemory/.env\n- REST API on port 3111 accepts Bearer auth\n- UI Viewer on port 3113 proxies with secret automatically\n- Kilo config has agentmemory MCP server enabled with AGENTMEMORY_URL and AGENTMEMORY_SECRET\n- Wrapper script at /Volumes/AI/Servers/agentmemory-kilo-hooks/agentmemory-wrapper.sh forces proxy mode (AGENTMEMORY_FORCE_PROXY=1)\n\nKey paths:\n- State store: /Volumes/AI/agentmemory/data/state_store.db/\n- Viewer: http://localhost:3113/\n- REST API: http://localhost:3111/agentmemory/\n- iii-engine config: /Volumes/AI/agentmemory/iii-config.yaml (port 49134 for WebSocket)","createdAt":"2026-05-22T17:22:18.855Z","files":["test/mcp-standalone.test.ts","test/mcp-standalone-proxy.test.ts","src/mcp/standalone.ts","src/viewer/server.ts"],"id":"mem_mph6tbag_47267d81f875","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Agentmemory Kilo integration test coverage completed successfully. Added 33 new ","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-22T17:22:18.855Z","version":1},"mem_mph6x35j_8913542217e1":{"concepts":["agentmemory","kilo","integration-testing","mcp","test-coverage"],"content":"Agentmemory Kilo integration test coverage completed. Added 33 new tests (74 total in standalone MCP tests). All 1124 tests pass across 98 test files. Coverage added: memory_export, memory_audit, session ID forwarding, handleToolsList proxy paths, normalizeList edge cases, type validation, format parsing. Authorization verified: secret in ~/.agentmemory/.env, REST API port 3111, Viewer port 3113.","createdAt":"2026-05-22T17:25:14.934Z","files":["test/mcp-standalone.test.ts","test/mcp-standalone-proxy.test.ts","src/mcp/standalone.ts","src/viewer/server.ts"],"id":"mem_mph6x35j_8913542217e1","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Agentmemory Kilo integration test coverage completed. Added 33 new tests (74 tot","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-22T17:25:14.934Z","version":1},"mem_mph6xkqh_1621279bd81e":{"concepts":[],"content":"Testing observation tracking in UI Viewer. This should appear as an observation in the current session.","createdAt":"2026-05-22T17:25:37.721Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mph6xkqh_1621279bd81e","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Testing observation tracking in UI Viewer. This should appear as an observation ","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-22T17:25:37.721Z","version":1},"mem_mpibs6hi_dd4113ee9833":{"concepts":["kilo_7cb4f3b0-2d0e-4b5c-993c-7c62fbbd98f0","pattern"],"content":"1. Previous Conversation:\n   The conversation began with the user requesting a plan to add a new setting in the GCodeGen app for defining work coordinates (G54 to G59), where G54 is the default, and the setting toggles whether the selected work coordinate is inserted into the final GCode (disabled b","createdAt":"2026-05-23T12:29:10.229Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpibs6hi_dd4113ee9833","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"1. Previous Conversation:\n   The conversation began with the user requesting a p","type":"pattern","updatedAt":"2026-05-23T12:29:10.229Z","version":1},"mem_mpig8cd2_e92c9ae711ed":{"concepts":["agentmemory","UI viewer","iii-engine bug","Redis workaround","StateKV","data migration","session display names","tab refresh"],"content":"Session: Fixed agentmemory UI viewer issues and iii-engine bug. (1) Fixed viewer sessionDisplayName() to show project/cwd/timestamp instead of raw ses_* IDs. (2) Fixed viewer tab data refresh bug - removed loaded flag so tabs reload on every switch. (3) Discovered iii-engine v0.12.0 bug: worker format adapter.config (store_method: file_based or name: redis) is ignored, KV store always uses in-memory. (4) Workaround: modified agentmemory src/state/kv.ts StateKV class to use Redis directly when REDIS_URL env var is set, bypassing broken iii-engine state module. (5) Migrated data from file-based .bin files to Redis. All sessions and memories restored.","createdAt":"2026-05-23T14:33:42.805Z","files":["/Volumes/AI/agentmemory/src/state/kv.ts","/Volumes/AI/agentmemory/src/viewer/index.html","/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/@agentmemory/agentmemory/dist/iii-config.yaml"],"id":"mem_mpig8cd2_e92c9ae711ed","isLatest":false,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Session: Fixed agentmemory UI viewer issues and iii-engine bug. (1) Fixed viewer","type":"workflow","updatedAt":"2026-05-23T14:33:42.805Z","version":1},"mem_mpigcdid_e9e1714bf708":{"concepts":["agentmemory","UI viewer","iii-engine bug","Redis workaround","StateKV","data migration","session display names","tab refresh"],"content":"Session: Fixed agentmemory UI viewer issues and iii-engine bug. (1) Fixed viewer sessionDisplayName() to show project/cwd/timestamp instead of raw ses_* IDs. (2) Fixed viewer tab data refresh bug - removed loaded flag so tabs reload on every switch. (3) Discovered iii-engine v0.12.0 bug: worker format adapter.config (store_method: file_based or name: redis) is ignored, KV store always uses in-memory. (4) Workaround: modified agentmemory src/state/kv.ts StateKV class to use Redis directly when REDIS_URL env var is set, bypassing broken iii-engine state module. (5) Migrated data from file-based .bin files to Redis. All sessions and memories restored.","createdAt":"2026-05-23T14:36:50.916Z","files":["/Volumes/AI/agentmemory/src/state/kv.ts","/Volumes/AI/agentmemory/src/viewer/index.html","/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/@agentmemory/agentmemory/dist/iii-config.yaml"],"id":"mem_mpigcdid_e9e1714bf708","isLatest":true,"parentId":"mem_mpig8cd2_e92c9ae711ed","sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":["mem_mpig8cd2_e92c9ae711ed"],"title":"Session: Fixed agentmemory UI viewer issues and iii-engine bug. (1) Fixed viewer","type":"workflow","updatedAt":"2026-05-23T14:36:50.916Z","version":2},"mem_mpih864c_439e1cb88c27":{"concepts":[],"content":"This memory tests the new title parameter for memory_save","createdAt":"2026-05-23T15:01:34.331Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpih864c_439e1cb88c27","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"This memory tests the new title parameter for memory_save","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-23T15:01:34.331Z","version":1},"mem_mpih8osm_97b4a83c8ded":{"concepts":[],"content":"Testing that the title parameter works correctly now","createdAt":"2026-05-23T15:01:58.534Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpih8osm_97b4a83c8ded","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Testing that the title parameter works correctly now","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-23T15:01:58.534Z","version":1},"mem_mpihg8nl_c9bf5a355bd4":{"concepts":[],"content":"Testing direct remember endpoint with custom title","createdAt":"2026-05-23T15:07:50.864Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpihg8nl_c9bf5a355bd4","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Testing direct remember endpoint with custom title","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-23T15:07:50.864Z","version":1},"mem_mpihlqst_479eda7f050e":{"concepts":[],"content":"Testing MCP call with custom title","createdAt":"2026-05-23T15:12:07.660Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpihlqst_479eda7f050e","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Testing MCP call with custom title","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-23T15:12:07.660Z","version":1},"mem_mpk49x9u_00cd2f644842":{"concepts":[],"content":"Test memory entry created to verify agentmemory tools are functioning correctly","createdAt":"2026-05-24T18:34:33.520Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mpk49x9u_00cd2f644842","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"Test memory entry created to verify agentmemory tools are functioning correctly","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-24T18:34:33.520Z","version":1},"mem_mplghtmy_0a081d2f6c38":{"concepts":[],"content":"test memory","createdAt":"2026-05-25T17:04:23.624Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mplghtmy_0a081d2f6c38","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"test memory","type":"fact","updatedAt":"2026-05-25T17:04:23.624Z","version":1},"mem_mplgsday_b3cdb54b771e":{"concepts":[],"content":"VS Code extension Git SHA version injection: Modified packages/kilo-vscode/script/build.ts (CI/CD) and packages/kilo-vscode/script/launch.ts (dev launch) to always append +SHA to version string. For launch.ts, SHA is injected into package.json before running bun run package. The version is read by KiloProvider.ts from vscode.extensions.getExtension().packageJSON.version and sent to the webview. Displayed in Settings > About Kilo Code tab via AboutKiloCodeTab.tsx.","createdAt":"2026-05-25T17:12:35.673Z","files":[],"id":"mem_mplgsday_b3cdb54b771e","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"VS Code extension Git SHA version injection: Modified packages/kilo-vscode/scrip","type":"workflow","updatedAt":"2026-05-25T17:12:35.673Z","version":1},"mem_mplqmdqa_e6791cdb7dd2":{"concepts":["ATC clearance","spoilboard cleaning","G-code","Y-axis constraints","Zone 1","Zone 2","incremental mode"],"content":"CleanY.ngc spoilboard cleaning macro for machine with ATC at Xâ‰¥20. Key constraints:\n- Zone 1 (X 0-20): Y sweeps full 0-48\"\n- Zone 2 (X 20-47): Y sweeps restricted 7.5-48\" (amplitude 40.5\") â€” Y must NEVER go below 7.5\" when X â‰¥ 20 (ATC collision zone)\n- Pattern: zigzag Y48/Y-48 in Zone 1, Y40.5/Y-40.5 in Zone 2, with X3 stepover between passes\n- Transition: at X=20, move Y from 0 to 7.5 before entering Zone 2\n- No dead X travel after last Y cleaning pass â€” the final X move should be part of the zigzag, not standalone\n- X stepover: 3\" increments (6Ã—X3 + X2 = 20\" in Zone 1, 9Ã—X3 = 27\" in Zone 2, ending at X=47\")\n- File location: /Volumes/gcode/macro/CleanY.ngc\n- Machine uses G20 (inches), G91 (incremental) for cleaning moves\n- Output 1 controls the cleaning device (M64 P1 on, M65 P1 off)","createdAt":"2026-05-25T21:47:52.447Z","files":["/Volumes/gcode/macro/CleanY.ngc"],"id":"mem_mplqmdqa_e6791cdb7dd2","isLatest":true,"sessionIds":[],"sourceObservationIds":[],"strength":7,"supersedes":[],"title":"CleanY.ngc spoilboard cleaning macro for machine with ATC at Xâ‰¥20. Key constrain","type":"pattern","updatedAt":"2026-05-25T21:47:52.447Z","version":1}}␀␀␀±²␀␀LÓÿÿ